      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Baxley%2C_Georgia"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Caroline Miller, winner of the 1934 Pulitzer Prize for Lamb in His Bosom, lived in Baxley while writing the novel.",
